+# Grounded Approach / need consequences: fixed eight-interval plan
+
+Frozen before native physical execution. This is a physical source/attribution
+fixture, not a learned neural policy, trained brain or scalar reward experiment.
+
+## Source and budget
+
+Ordinary-main ancestor: `550f79ad1f765132c634e7a272da56b521b57ec0`.
+Qualified opt-in source: PR #310 head
+`5163e3ff7d54b262b73eaafd6db9fb52bc473b4b`, tree
+`85e2ef5f2509a78db11393914fbe1bc921e3aa41`.
+The new patch contains only test code and this experiment's documentation.
+No production store, biology, policy, genetic asset, interface or default changes.
+
+Exactly four arms at each of initial loneliness 0 and .15. At most eight actual
+world intervals, one interval per disposable fork, from tick600 to601 at20Hz.
+No autonomous selector, neural inference, training, GPU/device, existing acquired
+state, private checkpoint, repeated observation, extension, or post-result tuning.
+A cold setup check and detached exact queries are not world intervals. A separate
+create-new run marker records each intent before execution; interruption consumes
+an uncertain slot and does not authorize replay. The test is ignored by default.
+
+## Frozen initialization and arms
+
+All subjects use genome seed921412, foundation identity(10,1,7,N512), freshly
+constructed biology at biological age600 and world tick600. Age600 is initialized,
+not lived history; report actual maturation/puberty/expression. The loneliness
+receptor's underlying chemical concentration is initialized to0 or.15 through a
+fresh in-memory serialized value, then the authoritative graph derives the whole
+homeostatic projection. This is neither a loaded private state nor a query-only
+mutation. The genome, all other initial drive readings, organs and development
+are unchanged. Preserve the original genotype and reference chemistry baseline.
+
+Subject is at(0,0,0), yaw0. Target is at(.8,0,0), radius.75, with identical grounded
+material properties in every arm. The unregistered static peer is organism2;
+its role is a physical peer-contact source, not a second simulated private brain.
+Each case is an isolated fork of the same unadvanced base body/scene:
+
+1. peer_approach: prescribed observed Approach to peer, ActionId101, familyApproach,
+   intensity1, only one command. Registered real execution and local steering own
+   movement. The nominal .1 step should enter the .75 contact region.
+2. toy_approach: the same physical target becomes an ActivityToy without organism
+   identity. Pose, radius and grounded material properties stay fixed. Prescribe
+   the same actual Approach primitive and intensity.
+3. peer_passive: the identical peer scene advances one ordinary tick without a
+   command. It starts outside contact and must remain stationary. It produces no
+   fictitious action memory or action receipt.
+4. peer_blocked: same prescribed peer Approach with four transparent solid sphere
+   obstacles at(±.4,0,0),(0,0,±.4), each radius.2. The intended physical cage leaves
+   the target visible but blocks travel. These obstacles are the declared
+   experimental difference, including their perceptual consequences.
+
+Measure the actual trajectory and endpoint touch. Do not infer contact from the
+primitive, target class, nominal geometry, or instruction. If the cage fails,
+there is no legal retry with changed geometry. Record intended_condition_met=false
+and keep that result. No other condition may be silently retuned after outcomes.
+
+## Evidence and ownership boundary
+
+Use actual registered-command receipts and canonical before/final-after biology.
+World finalization must preserve the receipt's already advanced biology exactly.
+Record pre/post pose, single movement segment, endpoint contacts, physical cost,
+body event, all eleven source-before/after/delta scalars, developmental state,
+timebase, entity and frame provenance. These are bodily measurements, not exported
+neural source vectors. No full sensory frame, sealed source JSON, memory store,
+private bank, optimizer, model activation or checkpoint is written to disk.
+
+The action is prescribed. Do not call its origin NeuralClosedLoopCpu or fabricate
+logit/work/confidence to pass the opt-in store's neural-origin admission guard.
+Command confidence1 only expresses the explicit test prescription; sensor
+confidence remains separate. There is no measured store/causal confidence.
+V1 provides no authentic prescribed-source adapter, so these operation receipts
+are not passed to observe() through a fake envelope. Exact same-source and actual
+next-source queries each run against an independent empty owner store and report
+Unknown; do not describe these as retrieval failures of a retained source.
+Record exact key equality separately to expose context changes independent of
+admission. No approximate match or arbitrary-pressure relief is admitted.
+
+Fixture fork names are explicit external ownership namespaces. Identical numeric
+seed/organism IDs across cloned controls do not establish a runtime world/life
+namespace. No observations are pooled between forks. There is no invented source
+sequence or sealed neural receipt digest. Prior Inspect observations are not
+relabeled as Approach observations.
+
+## What can and cannot be learned
+
+This could demonstrate an Approach-associated physical contact transition,
+eleven-drive differences from no-contact controls, and correct biology timing.
+It cannot demonstrate a learned action policy, neural causal credit, usable
+production memory admission, navigation, generalization or learned self-care.
+At pressure0, physiological baseline drift may make the next reading positive;
+measure it rather than assuming the zero-pressure arm has a zero interval delta.
+
+The controlling architecture distinguishes body-owned physical facts, canonical
+biology, non-reward drives, observed provenance and personal evidence
+(§§5–7,11.2–11.4,15–17). The preceding detached need-reader design remains separate.
+
+## Weight-space work rationale for Astra
+
+Original source: [Sparks of Weight-Space Programming](https://rikiyat.github.io/blog/weight-space-programming/),
+2November2026; checked8November2026.
+
+- Experiment4 edits an existing failing Kinetix car controller after inspecting
+  weights, the scene and one episode. It motivates specific failure diagnosis,
+  not treating a prescribed physical interval as a learned repair.
+- Experiment5 writes zero-initialized small MinAtar controllers with no feedback
+  before evaluation. This ongoing iterative A-Life work is not that zero-shot
+  regime and must not borrow its success claims.
+- Experiment6 constructs a larger Go controller with explicit, limited forward
+  evaluation budgets and iterative edits. It motivates our declared accounting,
+  but our eight physical intervals are not Go rollouts or neural forward passes.
+
+A-Life also has recurrent physiology, private lifetime state, uncertain memory
+and world-owned action validation. This fixture measures whether appropriate
+physical consequence evidence exists before any weight-level policy claim. It
+neither edits weights nor proves that the separate reader can use this source.
